WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.796
Sid moaned.

2
00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:14.328
"Ugh. I feel sick."

3
00:00:14.329 --> 00:00:18.340
Sara looked at Sid.

4
00:00:18.341 --> 00:00:21.904
"You have purple spots.

5
00:00:21.905 --> 00:00:25.308
Where are they from?"

6
00:00:25.309 --> 00:00:29.175
"I don't know," Sid said.

7
00:00:29.176 --> 00:00:32.925
"Did you eat anything?" Rex asked.

8
00:00:32.926 --> 00:00:37.664
"Um . . . no," Sid said.

9
00:00:37.665 --> 00:00:42.659
He held his belly.

10
00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.370
Rex looked at Tor and Sara.

11
00:00:45.371 --> 00:00:49.096
"How can we help Sid?" he asked.

12
00:00:49.097 --> 00:00:53.494
"I need to eat flowers," Sid said.

13
00:00:53.495 --> 00:00:56.729
"They will make me better."

14
00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:01.321
"I'll get flowers for you, buddy," Rex said.

15
00:01:01.322 --> 00:01:04.582
Rex ran off.

16
00:01:04.583 --> 00:01:10.910
"I'm thirsty," Sid moaned.

17
00:01:10.911 --> 00:01:14.208
"I'll get water for you!" Tor said.

18
00:01:14.209 --> 00:01:20.013
She flew off.

19
00:01:20.014 --> 00:01:23.847
Sid shook.

20
00:01:23.848 --> 00:01:26.658
"Brr!" he said.

21
00:01:26.659 --> 00:01:36.778
"I'm so cold."

22
00:01:36.779 --> 00:01:39.724
"I can help," Sara said.

23
00:01:39.725 --> 00:01:41.826
"I'll get big leaves.

24
00:01:41.827 --> 00:01:44.127
They'll keep you warm."

25
00:01:44.128 --> 00:01:46.967
Sara ran off.

26
00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:51.038
Sid was all alone.

27
00:01:51.039 --> 00:01:56.144
Sid opened his eyes.

28
00:01:56.145 --> 00:01:59.398
He looked around.

29
00:01:59.399 --> 00:02:04.073
He grinned. "Ha-ha!"

